text = input('Enter sentence: ')
upper_cnt, lower_cnt, digit_cnt = 0, 0, 0
for ch in text:
    if ch.isupper():
        upper_cnt += 1
    elif ch.islower():
        lower_cnt += 1
    elif ch.isdigit():
        digit_cnt += 1
print('Upper:', upper_cnt, '\nLower:', lower_cnt, '\nDigits:', digit_cnt)
```
